{%- comment -%}
  Tabbed info panel: FAQS / What To Expect / Reviews. Tab strip sits flush on
  a dark green panel; active tab is the dark one.
{%- endcomment -%}
<section class="lpt" id="lpTabs">
  <div class="lpt-tabs" role="tablist">
    <button class="lpt-tab is-active" data-tab="faqs" role="tab">FAQS</button>
    <button class="lpt-tab" data-tab="expect" role="tab">What To Expect</button>
    <button class="lpt-tab" data-tab="reviews" role="tab">Reviews</button>
  </div>

  <div class="lpt-panel">
    <div class="lpt-pane is-active" data-pane="faqs">
      <h2 class="lpt-h">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <div class="lpt-rule" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <details class="lpt-item"><summary>What is Pinemoor? <span class="lpt-btn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></summary><div class="lpt-body"><p>An organic herbal dropper taken daily. It changes the scent your skin gives off so ticks stop reading you as a host &mdash; whole-body protection from the inside out.</p></div></details>
      <details class="lpt-item"><summary>Is Pinemoor easy to use? <span class="lpt-btn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></summary><div class="lpt-body"><p>One full dropper each morning with water, coffee, or juice. No sprays, no reapplying, no missed spots.</p></div></details>
      <details class="lpt-item"><summary>Is it safe for daily use? <span class="lpt-btn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></summary><div class="lpt-body"><p>Yes &mdash; it&rsquo;s crafted for consistent daily use, in a maple syrup&ndash;flavored base the whole family takes from. No DEET, no synthetic pesticides.</p></div></details>
      <details class="lpt-item"><summary>Can I take it with other supplements? <span class="lpt-btn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></summary><div class="lpt-body"><p>Pinemoor is a botanical blend and fits into most routines. If you take prescription medication, check with your doctor first.</p></div></details>
      <details class="lpt-item"><summary>Where is it made? <span class="lpt-btn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></summary><div class="lpt-body"><p>Blended and bottled in the US in a GMP-compliant facility, and shipped from the US.</p></div></details>
      <details class="lpt-item"><summary>What if it doesn&rsquo;t work for me? <span class="lpt-btn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></summary><div class="lpt-body"><p>You&rsquo;re covered by our Lifetime Money-Back Guarantee &mdash; return your order at any time for a full refund. No deadlines, no questions.</p></div></details>
    </div>

    <div class="lpt-pane" data-pane="expect">
      <h2 class="lpt-h">What To Expect</h2>
      <div class="lpt-rule" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <details class="lpt-item" open><summary>Day 1: The botanicals go to work <span class="lpt-btn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></summary><div class="lpt-body"><p>Your first dropper absorbs within the hour &mdash; and the scent your skin gives off starts to shift.</p></div></details>
      <details class="lpt-item"><summary>Day 3&ndash;5: Ticks read you as &ldquo;wrong host&rdquo; <span class="lpt-btn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></summary><div class="lpt-body"><p>The window where most customers report complete repellence &mdash; ticks climb on, get confused, climb off.</p></div></details>
      <details class="lpt-item"><summary>Week 2: All-day confidence <span class="lpt-btn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></summary><div class="lpt-body"><p>Stand, creek bottom, tall grass &mdash; one morning dose covers up to 24 hours. Nothing to reapply.</p></div></details>
      <details class="lpt-item"><summary>Day 30+: Season-long armor <span class="lpt-btn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></summary><div class="lpt-body"><p>Coffee, drops, out the door. The whole family protected from the inside out, all season.</p></div></details>
    </div>

    <div class="lpt-pane" data-pane="reviews">
      <h2 class="lpt-h">Reviews</h2>
      <div class="lpt-rule" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <details class="lpt-item" open><summary>&ldquo;Bought it half expecting a gimmick.&rdquo; <span class="lpt-btn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></summary><div class="lpt-body"><p>&ldquo;Three weekends in the stand so far and not one tick. I&rsquo;m sold.&rdquo; &mdash; huntin_dad_42 &#10003; Verified</p></div></details>
      <details class="lpt-item"><summary>&ldquo;Whole family&rsquo;s on it now.&rdquo; <span class="lpt-btn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></summary><div class="lpt-body"><p>&ldquo;Two people from our church got diagnosed with Lyme. That was enough for me to stop messing around with sprays.&rdquo; &mdash; Mallory K. &#10003; Verified</p></div></details>
      <details class="lpt-item"><summary>&ldquo;The kids don&rsquo;t fight me on it.&rdquo; <span class="lpt-btn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></summary><div class="lpt-body"><p>&ldquo;The maple taste makes it easy. Did a full week at the lake and didn&rsquo;t pull a single tick off anybody.&rdquo; &mdash; Steph &#10003; Verified</p></div></details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
#shopify-section-{{ section.id }}{content-visibility:auto;contain-intrinsic-size:auto 900px;}
.lpt{background:#fff;}
.lpt-tabs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;}
.lpt-tab{font-family:var(--lp-body);font-size:17px;font-weight:500;color:#fff;background:#8FB8A5;
  padding:20px 6px;border-radius:14px 14px 0 0;margin-right:2px;transition:background .15s;}
.lpt-tab:last-child{margin-right:0;}
.lpt-tab.is-active{background:var(--lpg-mid);}
.lpt-panel{background:var(--lpg-mid);padding:34px 18px 40px;}
.lpt-pane{display:none;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;}
.lpt-pane.is-active{display:block;}
.lpt-h{font-family:var(--lp-head);font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(30px,8.4vw,38px);line-height:1.12;color:#fff;letter-spacing:-.01em;}
.lpt-rule{height:1px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.30);margin:22px 0 26px;}
.lpt-item{background:var(--lpg-row);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:16px;overflow:hidden;}
.lpt-item summary{list-style:none;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:26px 20px;
  font-family:var(--lp-body);font-size:19px;font-weight:500;color:#fff;line-height:1.3;}
.lpt-item summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none;}
.lpt-btn{flex:none;margin-left:auto;width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--lp-mint);color:var(--lpg-deep);
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;transition:transform .25s;}
.lpt-btn svg{width:15px;height:15px;}
.lpt-item[open] .lpt-btn{transform:rotate(90deg);}
.lpt-body{padding:0 20px 22px;}
.lpt-body p{font-family:var(--lp-body);font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:rgba(255,255,255,.85);}
</style>

<script>
(function(){
  var tabs=[].slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('#lpTabs .lpt-tab'));
  var panes=[].slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('#lpTabs .lpt-pane'));
  tabs.forEach(function(t){
    t.addEventListener('click',function(){
      tabs.forEach(function(x){x.classList.remove('is-active');});
      panes.forEach(function(p){p.classList.toggle('is-active',p.getAttribute('data-pane')===t.getAttribute('data-tab'));});
      t.classList.add('is-active');
    });
  });
})();
</script>

{% schema %}{"name":"LP Info Tabs","settings":[]}{% endschema %}
